{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52177","headline":"颂六十二首 二 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遗身八万塔，宝饰高百丈。\n仪凤异灵鸟，金盘代佛（一作「盘代仙」）掌。\n积拱承雕月（一作「角」），高檐挂树网。\n宝地若池沙，风铃如积响。\n刻削生千变，丹青图万像。\n烟霞时出没，神仙乍来往。\n晨雾半层生，飞幡接云上。\n游蜺不敢息，翔鵾讵能仰。\n福地下金绳，天报岂虚枉（一作「圣变无穷端，感福岂三两」）。\n愿假舟航末（一作「木」），彼岸谁云广？\n（见同书卷三《敬塔部》。\n注一作者，爲《法苑珠林》卷五一《敬塔篇》之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}